erification.json"} {"question" "q-74088" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ddbf1755e389721b5699fd87b6d64f8c9041b32617e322cc23dfb2983b00e34" "basis" 1215 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74088" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "(6x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ddbf1755e389721b5699fd87b6d64f8c9041b32617e322cc23dfb2983b00e34" "basis" 1215 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}4x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ddbf1755e389721b5699fd87b6d64f8c9041b32617e322cc23dfb2983b00e34" "basis" 1215 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=4x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=4 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x) & ⇒ & v=-\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 4x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x & =4x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x))-\\int (-\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x))\\cdot 4\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}4x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\,{|}_{0}^{1}+\\frac{4}{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\,{|}_{0}^{1}+\\frac{4}{{\\pi }^{2}}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }(1\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 1)-0\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 0))+\\frac{4}{{\\pi }^{2}}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 1)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 0)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }(-1-0)+\\frac{4}{{\\pi }^{2}}(0-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ddbf1755e389721b5699fd87b6d64f8c9041b32617e322cc23dfb2983b00e34" "basis" 1215 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "640ecc0f815d7582c1b911b92d4daaa1f3b664c6db18b53fa8ca347a8dcad340" "basis" 1215 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ddbf1755e389721b5699fd87b6d64f8c9041b32617e322cc23dfb2983b00e34" "basis" 1215 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{4}{\\pi}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ddbf1755e389721b5699fd87b6d64f8c9041b32617e322cc23dfb2983b00e34" "basis" 1215 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/edb-import/verification.json"}] "sources" [{"question" "q-114290" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral $\\int (x-2){e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-114290" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (x-2){e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x-2\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{x+3}\\, & ⟹\\,v={e}^{x+3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (x-2)\\cdot {e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x & =(x-2)\\cdot {e}^{x+3}-\\int {e}^{x+3}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x-2){e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x & =(x-2){e}^{x+3}-\\int {e}^{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(x-2){e}^{x+3}-{e}^{x+3}+C \\\\  & =(x-3){e}^{x+3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-114290" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1a77b5d0d3582ab92a8158644acff6d27ec0cbf8ee8f7abf77b21d7ef73cdffb"} {"question" "q-114290" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-114290" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "(2x-1){e}^{x+3}+C"] ["math" "(\\frac{x}{2}-3){e}^{x+3}+C"] ["math" "(\\frac{x}{3}-6){e}^{x+3}+C"] ["math" "(\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+3){e}^{x+3}+C"] ["math" "(x-3){e}^{x+3}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-114290" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "(x-3){e}^{x+3}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-14434" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int 6x{e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-14434" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 6x{e}^{4x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=6x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=6 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{4x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{1}{4}{e}^{4x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 6x\\cdot {e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x & =6x\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}{e}^{4x}-\\int \\frac{1}{4}{e}^{4x}\\cdot 6\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 6x{e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{3}{2}x{e}^{4x}-\\frac{3}{2}\\int {e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3x{e}^{4x}}{2}-\\frac{3{e}^{4x}}{8}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-14434" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1a77b5d0d3582ab92a8158644acff6d27ec0cbf8ee8f7abf77b21d7ef73cdffb"} {"question" "q-14434" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-14434" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{3x{e}^{4x}}{2}-\\frac{3{e}^{4x}}{8}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{3x{e}^{4x}}{2}-\\frac{3{e}^{4x}}{9}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x{e}^{4x}}{2}-\\frac{3{e}^{4x}}{8}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x{e}^{4x}}{3}+\\frac{x{e}^{4x}}{9}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{3}+\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{9}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-14434" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{3x{e}^{4x}}{2}-\\frac{3{e}^{4x}}{8}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int (3x-4){e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (3x-4){e}^{-3x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=3x-4\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=3 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-3x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (3x-4)\\cdot {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =(3x-4)\\cdot (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})-\\int (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3x-4){e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{(3x-4){e}^{-3x}}{3}+\\int {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{(3x-4){e}^{-3x}}{3}-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{(3x-3){e}^{-3x}}{3}+C \\\\  & =(1-x){e}^{-3x}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1a77b5d0d3582ab92a8158644acff6d27ec0cbf8ee8f7abf77b21d7ef73cdffb"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "(1-x){e}^{-3x}+C"] ["math" "(2-3x){e}^{-3x}+C"] ["math" "(2x-1){e}^{-3x}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(2-x){e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(2x-1){e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037313/state.json" "file_sha256" "6ee97563daa16ea5c1378e058847b8af9ab780c1bde093e08acd54f2a021ab4b"} {"question" "